WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:04.809
Video 11. Payment, receipt ane contra.

00:00:05.009 --> 00:00:09.250
Tamara paisa rokad ma ane bank account ma
chhe.

00:00:09.180 --> 00:00:12.862
Payment, F5, paisa bahar mokle chhe.

00:00:12.792 --> 00:00:17.244
Receipt, F6, grahak paase thi paisa laave
chhe.

00:00:17.174 --> 00:00:22.557
Contra, F4, rokad ane bank vachche paisa ferve
chhe.

00:00:22.856 --> 00:00:28.223
V dabavo to vouchers khule chhe. F5 etle
payment.

00:00:28.253 --> 00:00:33.151
Account ma Cash ke bank pasand karo: paisa ema
thi jaay chhe.

00:00:33.214 --> 00:00:39.075
Particulars ma ledger pasand karo: Rent.
Pachhi rakam: ₹25,000.

00:00:39.110 --> 00:00:45.781
Narration lakho, ane Ctrl+A dabavo. Hisaab
bank ni vigat maange chhe.

00:00:45.811 --> 00:00:51.631
Transaction type Cheque chhe. Favouring name
lakho, ane A/c Payee.

00:00:52.333 --> 00:00:56.211
Cheque book no aagal no number Hisaab jaate
bhare chhe.

00:00:56.241 --> 00:00:59.407
Ctrl+A thi payment save thaay chhe.

00:01:00.514 --> 00:01:08.339
F6 etle receipt: paisa aave chhe. Party Sharma
Traders, ₹54,560.

00:01:09.038 --> 00:01:13.808
Agst Ref ma baaki bills dekhay chhe: 2 April
nu invoice 1.

00:01:14.038 --> 00:01:19.368
Invoice 1 pasand karo. Aa receipt thi aakhu
bill chukte thaay chhe.

00:01:19.972 --> 00:01:25.324
Narration lakho, ane Ctrl+A. Pachhi bank ni
vigat.

00:01:25.354 --> 00:01:29.712
Grahak na cheque no number, ane bank nu naam
lakho.

00:01:30.410 --> 00:01:33.774
Ctrl+A thi receipt save thaay chhe.

00:01:34.854 --> 00:01:41.539
F4 etle contra. Account ma je bank ma paisa
jama thaay e pasand karo.

00:01:41.569 --> 00:01:48.055
Particulars ma Cash: ₹20,000. Narration lakho,
ane Ctrl+A.

00:01:48.754 --> 00:01:52.307
Ahiya transaction type Cash chhe: list ma Cash
lakho.

00:01:52.337 --> 00:01:56.014
Ctrl+A thi contra save thaay chhe.

00:01:56.494 --> 00:02:00.628
Pahela bank ma ₹5,94,000 hata.

00:02:00.558 --> 00:02:04.854
Have ema ₹6,43,560 chhe.

00:02:05.055 --> 00:02:09.958
Have pachhi: journal, credit note ane debit
note.

